# Fork-local merge policy (adamlsneed/omi).
#
# The guardrail pulse history is appended independently by this fork's and
# upstream's scheduled pulses, and the counts are tree-specific, so upstream's
# entries are never correct here. Every upstream sync resolves this file with
# --ours; the "ours" driver automates that resolution.
#
# The driver must be defined once per clone (make setup does not manage it):
#   git config merge.ours.driver true
# Without that config, git falls back to a normal merge and the file conflicts
# exactly as before, so this attribute is safe on fresh clones.
.github/guardrail-pulse-history.jsonl merge=ours
